# Must be rejected by HermiT (make disjointness-check). Neurostimulation is
# delivered without the individual's active self-regulation, so one process
# cannot be both neurostimulation and self-directed neuromodulation (ADR 0068).
@prefix example: <https://example.org/sstim/disjointness-fixture/> .
@prefix sstim:   <https://w3id.org/sstim#> .

example:process a sstim:Neurostimulation, sstim:SelfDirectedNeuromodulation .
